
========================================================================================
LRC(14) SUPPORT-6 COIMAGE FIBER ATLAS S14
========================================================================================
Goal: compute the finite mod-7 coimage of the support-6 relation hyperplane, with speed residues allowed to be 0.

========================================================================================
PROJECTIVE SPEED-RESIDUE COIMAGE CLASSES
========================================================================================
projective support classes modulo F_7^* and S_6: 159
zero-speed-residue histogram: {0: 80, 1: 42, 2: 22, 3: 10, 4: 4, 5: 1}
The 159 classes are the finite coimage table for exact support 6. A zero here means a support speed is divisible by 7; that coordinate is still Fourier-live, but disappears from the mod-7 relation.

